---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import hebrewWorkshop from "../../../public/files/linear-algebra-lab/llm-activities.json";
import englishWorkshop from "../../../public/files/linear-algebra-lab/llm-activities-en.json";
import CourseLanguageSwitch from "./CourseLanguageSwitch.astro";
import { escapeHtml } from "../../lib/linearLabPlot.mjs";
import "../../styles/linear-lab.css";
const { locale = "he" } = Astro.props as { locale?: "he" | "en" };
const workshop = locale === "en" ? englishWorkshop : hebrewWorkshop;
const t = (he: string, en: string) => (locale === "en" ? en : he);
const direction = locale === "en" ? "ltr" : "rtl";
const labPath = `/teaching/linear-algebra/lab/${locale === "en" ? "en/" : ""}`;
const packPath = `/files/linear-algebra-lab/llm-activities${locale === "en" ? "-en" : ""}.json`;
---

<Layout
  title="Guided LLM Activities | Linear Algebra"
  description="Eight guided Linear Algebra activities by Chen Gadi: create plots with an LLM, identify missing assumptions, and verify answers independently. Available in Hebrew and English."
>
  <div class="la-lab" dir="ltr" lang="en" id="linear-llm" data-locale={locale}>
    <header class="la-llm-hero">
      <div class="la-container">
        <a class="la-back" href={labPath}>
          ← Back to the interactive lab
        </a>
        <CourseLanguageSwitch locale={locale} page="llm" />
        <p class="la-eyebrow">Chen Gadi · Linear Algebra</p>
        <h1>Guided LLM activities</h1>
        <p class="la-lead">
          Use an LLM to create a plot, explore an approach, or improve code.
          Then check the answer and its assumptions. Choose Hebrew or English
          above.
        </p>
        <div class="la-actions">
          <a href="#activities" class="la-button">
            Choose an activity ↓
          </a>
          <a href="#journal" class="la-button la-secondary">
            My experiment notebook ↓
          </a>
          <button type="button" id="llm-print" class="la-text-button">
            Print or save as PDF
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="la-subtle">
          Copy a prompt into your preferred model. This page does not call an
          LLM automatically; no paid subscription is required.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="la-container la-llm-content">
      <section
        class="la-protocol"
        lang={locale}
        dir={direction}
        aria-labelledby="protocol-title"
      >
        <p class="la-eyebrow">{t("הדרך חשובה כמו התשובה", "Working method")}</p>
        <h2 id="protocol-title">
          {t("אותו סדר עבודה בכל פעילות", "Steps for each activity")}
        </h2>
        <ol>
          {workshop.protocol.map((p) => (
            <li>{p}</li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <p class="la-subtle">
          {t(
            "אין כאן שאלה שמובטח שכל מודל יטעה בה. המטרה היא לבדוק טיעון מתמטי, גם כשהתשובה נשמעת משכנעת וגם כשהיא נכונה.",
            "No question is guaranteed to make every model fail. Check the mathematical argument even when the answer sounds convincing or is correct.",
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <nav
        id="activities"
        class="la-llm-index"
        aria-label="Choose an LLM activity"
      >
        {workshop.activities.map((a, i) => (
          <a href={`#${a.id}`} lang={locale} dir={direction}>
            {String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")} · {a.title}
          </a>
        ))}
      </nav>
      {workshop.activities.map((a, i) => (
        <article
          class="la-llm-card"
          lang={locale}
          dir={direction}
          id={a.id}
          aria-labelledby={`title-${a.id}`}
        >
          <>
            <p class="la-eyebrow" lang="en" dir="ltr">
              Activity {i + 1} · Homework {a.homework} · After tutorial{" "}
              {a.tutorial}
            </p>
            <h2 id={`title-${a.id}`}>{a.title}</h2>
            <p>{a.purpose}</p>
          </>
          <>
            <h3>
              {t("01 · לפני שפונים למודל", "01 · Before asking the model")}
            </h3>
            <p>{a.prediction}</p>
          </>
          <>
            <h3>{t("02 · הנחיה שאותה בודקים", "02 · Prompt to examine")}</h3>
            <pre
              class="la-prompt"
              id={`prompt-${a.id}`}
              tabindex="0"
              set:html={escapeHtml(a.prompt)}
            />
            <button
              class="la-text-button"
              lang="en"
              dir="ltr"
              data-copy={`prompt-${a.id}`}
              type="button"
            >
              Copy prompt ⧉
            </button>
            <p
              class="la-copy-status"
              id={`copy-status-${a.id}`}
              role="status"
            />
          </>
          <p class="la-subtle">
            {t(
              "בחלק מההנחיות משולבת בכוונה הנחה שיש לבדוק. הוראת הפתרון המחייבת היא לברר אם ההנחה תקפה, ולא לאמץ אותה.",
              "Some prompts deliberately include an assumption to examine. Your task is to check whether it is valid.",
            )}
          </p>
          <>
            <h3>{t("03 · העבודה שלכם", "03 · Your tasks")}</h3>
            <ol>
              {a.tasks.map((t) => (
                <li>{t}</li>
              ))}
            </ol>
          </>
          <div
            class="la-evidence"
            aria-label={t("תוצרי הפעילות", "Activity deliverables")}
          >
            {a.deliverables.map((d) => (
              <span>{d}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="la-actions" style="margin-top:18px">
            <>
              <a
                class="la-text-button"
                lang="en"
                dir="ltr"
                href={`${labPath}#tutorial-${a.tutorial}`}
              >
                Related interactive lab ↗
              </a>
              <button
                class="la-text-button"
                lang="en"
                dir="ltr"
                type="button"
                data-journal={a.id}
              >
                Open this activity in my notebook ↓
              </button>
            </>
          </div>
          <details>
            <>
              <summary>
                {t("רמז להנחיה מדויקת יותר", "Hint: a more precise prompt")}
              </summary>
              <pre
                class="la-prompt"
                id={`repair-${a.id}`}
                style="margin-top:15px"
                set:html={escapeHtml(a.repairedPrompt)}
              />
              <button
                type="button"
                class="la-text-button"
                lang="en"
                dir="ltr"
                data-copy={`repair-${a.id}`}
              >
                Copy revised prompt ⧉
              </button>
            </>
          </details>
          <details>
            <>
              <summary>
                {t(
                  "לניתוח כשאין גישה למודל: תשובת דוגמה שגויה",
                  "If a model is unavailable: an incorrect teaching example",
                )}
              </summary>
              <p class="la-flawed">{a.flawedExample}</p>
              <p class="la-subtle">
                {t(
                  "זהו טקסט לימודי שנכתב לפעילות. הוא אינו תיעוד של תשובת ChatGPT, Gemini או מודל אחר.",
                  "This example was written for the activity. It is not a recorded response from ChatGPT, Gemini, or another model.",
                )}
              </p>
            </>
          </details>
          <details class="llm-solution">
            <summary>
              {t(
                "לאחר ניסיון עצמאי: דרך בדיקה ופתרון",
                "After your own attempt: verification and solution",
              )}
            </summary>
            {a.solution.map((p) => (
              <p>{p}</p>
            ))}
          </details>
        </article>
      ))}
      <section id="journal" class="la-journal" aria-labelledby="journal-title">
        <p class="la-eyebrow">Activity records</p>
        <h2 id="journal-title">My experiment notebook</h2>
        <p class="la-subtle">
          Notes stay in this browser. They are not sent to Chen or submitted for
          grading. Download all records as a text file. No name or student ID is
          needed.
        </p>
        <form id="llm-journal-form">
          <label for="llm-activity">Activity</label>
          <select id="llm-activity">
            {workshop.activities.map((a, i) => (
              <option value={a.id} lang={locale} dir={direction}>
                {i + 1} · {a.title}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <div class="la-journal-fields">
            <div>
              <label for="llm-model">Model and version as displayed</label>
              <input
                id="llm-model"
                maxlength="200"
                placeholder="If no version is shown, say so"
                autocomplete="off"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="llm-date">Date of experiment</label>
              <input type="date" id="llm-date" />
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-prediction">
                My prediction and independent attempt
              </label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-prediction"
                rows="3"
                maxlength="12000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-prompt">The prompt I actually sent</label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-prompt"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="20000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-response">
                Original response, or the clearly labelled teaching example
              </label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-response"
                rows="5"
                maxlength="30000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-check">
                My verification: definition, substitution, or counterexample
              </label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-check"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="20000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-revision">
                Revised prompt and changes in the response
              </label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-revision"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="20000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="la-journal-field-wide">
              <label for="llm-conclusion">
                My conclusion and what remains unchecked
              </label>
              <textarea
                dir="auto"
                lang={locale}
                id="llm-conclusion"
                rows="3"
                maxlength="12000"
              ></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="la-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="la-button">
              Save this record in my browser ✓
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="llm-export"
              class="la-button la-secondary"
            >
              Download all my records ↓
            </button>
          </div>
          <p id="llm-journal-status" class="la-copy-status" role="status"></p>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section class="la-protocol" lang={locale} dir={direction}>
        <h2>{t("כלי עזר שאפשר לבדוק", "Python resources")}</h2>
        <p>
          {t(
            "אחרי החישוב העצמאי אפשר להריץ את בדיקות הדוגמאות ב־Python, או להשתמש בקוד ההתחלתי לגרפים. הרצה מוצלחת אינה מחליפה הוכחה כללית.",
            "After your independent calculation, run the Python example checks or use the starter plotting code. Passing example checks does not replace a general proof.",
          )}
        </p>
        <div class="la-actions">
          <a
            class="la-text-button"
            lang="en"
            dir="ltr"
            href="/files/linear-algebra-lab/verify_examples.py"
            download
          >
            Exact example checks (Python) ↓
          </a>
          <a
            class="la-text-button"
            lang="en"
            dir="ltr"
            href="/files/linear-algebra-lab/plot_starter.py"
            download
          >
            Starter plotting code ↓
          </a>
          <a
            class="la-text-button"
            lang="en"
            dir="ltr"
            href={packPath}
            download
          >
            Activity pack (JSON) ↓
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="la-subtle">
          {t(
            "קוד הבדיקה משתמש בספרייה התקנית של Python. קוד הגרפים דורש Matplotlib; ההנחיות נמצאות בראש הקובץ.",
            "The checker uses the Python standard library. The plotting code requires Matplotlib; setup instructions are at the top of the file.",
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <details class="la-teacher" lang={locale} dir={direction}>
        <summary>
          {t(
            "לחן ולצוות ההוראה: שילוב, מחוון ומקורות",
            "For Chen and the teaching team: use, rubric, and sources",
          )}
        </summary>
        <p>
          {t(
            "שמונה פעילויות חדשות משולבות לפי נושא במטלות 1, 2, 3, 6, 9 ו־11. במטלה 11 שלוש פעילויות, המתאימות לשלבים שונים: לכסון, היטלים ומכפלה פנימית מרוכבת. בוחרים פעילות לפי הנושאים שכבר נלמדו. הוראות ההגשה הקובעות מתפרסמות בעמוד הקורס.",
            "The eight activities correspond to homework 1, 2, 3, 6, 9, and 11. Homework 11 has three activities for different stages: diagonalization, projection, and complex inner products. Choose an activity after its topics have been taught. The course page provides the applicable submission instructions.",
          )}
        </p>
        <p>{workshop.teacherNotes.grading}</p>
        <p>{workshop.teacherNotes.success}</p>
        <p>{workshop.teacherNotes.evidence}</p>
        {workshop.teacherNotes.research.map((r) => (
          <p>
            <a href={r.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {r.title} ↗
            </a>{" "}
            · {r.note}
          </p>
        ))}
      </details>
      <p class="la-subtle">
        Questions for Chen? Use the{" "}
        <a href="/students" class="la-text-button">
          Student Hub ↗
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script
    id="llm-workshop-data"
    type="application/json"
    set:html={JSON.stringify(workshop).replace(/</g, "\\u003c")}
  />
  <script>
    import "../../scripts/linear-llm.js";
  </script>
</Layout>
